        "created_at": "2015-03-13T12:02:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome to the forums! &nbsp; I don't have cards on me for Sentinel tactics but there shouldn't be any issue with having both of those out at the same time. This is a different Bunker suit than what he had in the SotM card game so it can do things his other suit couldn't. &nbsp;</p>",
