        "created_at": "2015-03-13T12:32:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There's no rule against having both Turret Mode and Artillery Mode in play together. Combining these two cards can lead to a devastating turn, if Bunker can start his turn in a position on the board to take advantage of it.</p>",
